{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:13 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：07:13 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：07:13 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27c3e4ba8be8a5d2b488e1e5acf9f0e4/2026-10/2026-10-29_23_10_46.png\"/><p>高空反氣旋正為廣東帶來大致良好的天氣。</p><p>本港地區今日天晴。日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。</p><img alt=\"日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b1133b262a521fdd925f0d09abdc576/2026-10/28_3.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ffda282942354eb3b49c97fcd4e8af48/2026-10/2026-10-29_23_03_57.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e072bc70e71a8e530fe70e012156c005/2026-10/2026-10-29_23_03_37.png\"/><img alt=\"日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee23aa8f8c376ca53404442c8abd558e/2026-10/29_3.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"日間乾燥，市區最高氣溫約30度，新界再高一兩度。蔡楚輝攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/577752fb8c257f3804fefcd3be679e0a/2026-10/31_3.jpeg\"/><p>展望明日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。隨後一兩日部分時間有陽光。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T00:00:47.389131+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T23:13:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T03:18:41.813582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T23:58:33.095852+00:00","content_hash":"2662eb8f2ac7bca581284b29737b47b5172a455ecd96e57bb1146787806ed5b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}